msgid "Filesystem path that was denied (never NULL)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock:317: ../include/trace/events/landlock.h:682
msgid ""
"Resolved path string (never NULL; an error placeholder on resolution "
"failure)."
