msgid "``u64 target_domain_id``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock:317: ../include/trace/events/landlock.h:841
msgid "The target's Landlock domain ID, or 0 if the target is unsandboxed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock:317: ../include/trace/events/landlock.h:844
msgid "``const struct task_struct *target``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock:317: ../include/trace/events/landlock.h:843
msgid ""
"The task the signal was aimed at (never NULL).  target_pid is the init-"
"namespace TGID (like audit's opid)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock:317: ../include/trace/events/landlock.h:845
msgid ""
"Emitted when a Landlock domain denies signal delivery to a scoped-out target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock:317: ../include/trace/events/landlock.h:883
msgid ""
"Abstract unix socket access denied by LANDLOCK_SCOPE_ABSTRACT_UNIX_SOCKET"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock:317: ../include/trace/events/landlock.h:891
msgid "``u64 peer_domain_id``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock:317: ../include/trace/events/landlock.h:890
msgid "The peer's Landlock domain ID, or 0 if the peer is unsandboxed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock:317: ../include/trace/events/landlock.h:893
msgid "``const struct sock *peer``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock:317: ../include/trace/events/landlock.h:892
msgid ""
"Peer socket (never NULL).  peer_pid is best-effort: it is 0 for a datagram "
"peer (no SO_PEERCRED), so sun_path is the reliable peer identifier."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../trace/events-landlock:317: ../include/trace/events/landlock.h:895
